                                "sense_id": "b4062fe6-b418-370b-a59b-ff197d37c105",
                                "text": "Don't speak in parables\nAbout a valley where corn unsickens\nOn brittle stalks and a blind girl sees the sunlight thicken\nIn the apple trees."
