                                "sense_id": "b4062fe6-b418-370b-a59b-ff197d37c105",
                                "text": "Baldwin felt the blood flushing his face, turning his unsickened skin a vibrant shade of cooked-crab red, while the damaged skin remained uncolored and so highlighted."
